Specification data
------------------

obis/obis.yaml holds the value group tables and standard object codes of
IEC 62056-6-1:2023 (OBIS), the COSEM object to interface class relations
of IEC 62056-6-2:2023 clause 6, and the media 4 to 9 tables of EN
13757-1:2021 clause 11, as facts: numbers, ranges, country names, class
identifiers, and clause and table references. The names and labels are
our own wording.

is15959/ holds the object catalogue of IS 15959 Parts 1 (2011), 2 (2016,
with Amendments 1 and 2 of 2017) and 3 (2017) as facts: OBIS codes,
interface classes, attributes, units, access rights per association,
capture objects, event codes, push setups and association parameters,
with clause and table references. The names are our own wording.

No text of these standards is reproduced, and none of them is
redistributed. See PROVENANCE.md.

